NOTE ON DATA AND MODELS

The ECG images used to train the models in this repository are derived from the
MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database, distributed by PhysioNet (https://physionet.org/)
under its own terms. This MIT License covers the source code and the trained
model artifacts produced in this work; it does not extend to the underlying
MIT-BIH data, which remains subject to the license of its original distributor.

TrainECG is an educational tool for training in ECG interpretation. It is NOT a
medical device and is NOT intended for diagnostic use.
